Upstream baseline
-----------------

The sources were exported with `git archive` from the v1.3.9 tags, without
any upstream git history. In the baseline commit, the tree hash of each
directory is identical to the tree hash of the corresponding upstream tag:

    directory    upstream             tag     commit                                    tree
    edge-api     TeaOSLab/EdgeAPI     v1.3.9  40b7bf03b5d24140c1d2a885213f41b3c0e43ed1  dff150ff181d3a5525c0fe4747c8ff33119472fb
    edge-admin   TeaOSLab/EdgeAdmin   v1.3.9  3b8e04d421d791270ba236c4377c0c40bc97793a  1678674bc56a15333e7a08d245e7ed59a256f14e
    edge-common  TeaOSLab/EdgeCommon  v1.3.9  ae7ca4b083d2773ef3db2ab88d94d1fc1d4b1285  0bce8d85fba12682e9bdce487235f4a50ec29b4c
    edge-node    TeaOSLab/EdgeNode    v1.3.9  b0d1f2c8ea268dacc812f88cdb5acafd5af1414d  126aff3f9501e01f84a67c9c10444d4f46df8b33

To check a directory against upstream:

    git rev-parse <baseline-commit>:edge-api
    # in a clone of TeaOSLab/EdgeAPI:
    git rev-parse 'v1.3.9^{tree}'

